e-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg> <!-- -->2 min</span></div><h1>Xiaomi Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G 8+512 Go à -31% : 299€ au lieu de 433€</h1><p class=\"article-subtitle\">Xiaomi Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G 512 Go à 299€ au lieu de 433€ sur Amazon. Choix d&#x27;Amazon, 4,4/5, 1233 avis. 200 MP, batterie 6580 mAh, AMOLED 6,83 pouces.</p><div class=\"article-rating-bar\"><a href=\"https://amzn.to/3Q4AYT1\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir le prix sur Amazon<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"article-hero-image\" style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;max-height:450px\"><img alt=\"Xiaomi Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G 512 Go promo Amazon 2026\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;max-height:450px\" src=\"/images/articles/amazon-xiaomi-redmi-note-15-pro-5g-512go-promo-2026.svg\"/></div><div class=\"ad-container \" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"><ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display:block\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5064203547863113\" data-ad-slot=\"1564426359\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins></div><div style=\"background:var(--surface, #fefce8);padding:1.25rem;border-radius:12px;margin:2rem 0\"><form style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\"><svg xmlns