ren\":[\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://amzn.to/3Q4AYT1\",\"className\":\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"nofollow sponsored noopener\",\"children\":[\"Voir le prix sur Amazon\",\" \",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":13,\"height\":13,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-external-link\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$L3\",\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]]}]]}],\"$L6\",\"$L7\",\"$L8\",\"$L9\",\"$La\",\"$Lb\"]}],\"$Lc\",\"$Ld\",\"$Le\",\"$Lf\"]}]}],\"$L10\",\"$L11\"],[\"$L12\"],\"$L13\"]}],\"loading\":null,\"isPartial\":false}\n3:[\"$\",\"path\",\"1q9fwt\",{\"d\":\"M15 3h6v6\"}]\n4:[\"$\",\"path\",\"gplh6r\",{\"d\":\"M10 14 21 3\"}]\n5:[\"$\",\"path\",\"a6xqqp\",{\"d\":\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"}]\n6:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"article-hero-image\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"#fff\",\"borderRadius\":\"12px\",\"overflow\":\"hidden\",\"display\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\",\"alignItems\":\"center\",\"maxHeight\":\"450px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L14\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/articles/amazon-xiaomi-redmi-note-15-pro-5g-512go-promo-2026.svg\",\"alt\":\"Xiaomi Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G 512 Go promo Amazon 2026\",\"width\":800,\"height\":450,\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"100%\",\"objectFit\":\"contain\",\"maxHeight\":\"450px\"},\"priority\":true}]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{}]\n17:Tdce,<p>\n# Xiaomi Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G à -31% sur Amazon</p><p>Le <strong>Xiaomi Redmi Note 15 Pro 5G</strong> en version <strong>8+512 Go</strong> passe à <strong>299€ au lieu de 433€</strong> sur Amazon. Badge <strong>Choix d'Amazon</strong> et <strong>offre à forte demande</strong>.</p><h2>Le deal</h2><ul><li>~~433€~~ → <strong>299€</strong> soit <strong>-31%</strong> (économie de 134€)</li>\n<li><strong>Offre à forte demande</strong></li>\n<li>Badge <strong>Choix d'Amazon</strong></li>\n<li><strong>4,4/5 étoiles</strong> sur 1233 avis</li>\n<li>Paiement en <strong>4 fois sans frais</strong> (74,75€/mois)</li>\n<li>Garantie <strong>2 ans</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://amzn.to/3Q4AYT1\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir le prix sur Amazon <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>La fiche technique</h2><ul><li><strong>Écran AMOLED 1.5K de 6,83 pouces</strong> — lumineux et fluide</li>\n<li><strong>Appareil photo 200 MP</strong> — détails impressionnants même en zoom</li>\n<li><strong>8 Go de RAM + 512 Go de stockage</strong> — espace pour tout</li>\n<li><strong>Batterie 6580 mAh</strong> — autonomie massive, tient facilement 2 jours</li>\n<li><strong>5G</strong> — connexion ultra rapide</li>\n<li><strong>IP66/IP68</strong> — résistant à l'eau et à la poussière</li>\n<li>Coloris Noir</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"ezoic-pub-ad-placeholder-203\" class=\"ad-container\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"></div><h2>Redmi Note 15 Pro vs la concurrence</h2><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>Critère</th><th>Redmi Note 15 Pro</th><th>Samsung Galaxy A55</th><th>iPhone SE 4</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Prix</td>\n<td><strong>299€</strong></td>\n<td>~350€</td>\n<td>~499€</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stockage</td>\n<td><strong>512 Go</strong></td>\n<td>128 Go</td>\n<td>128 Go</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Batterie</td>\n<td><strong>6580 mAh</strong></td>\n<td>5000 mAh</td>\n<td>3500 mAh</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Photo principale</td>\n<td><strong>200 MP</strong></td>\n<td>50 MP</td>\n<td>48 MP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Écran</td>\n<td>6,83\" AMOLED</td>\n<td>6,6\" AMOLED</td>\n<td>6,1\" OLED</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://amzn.to/3Q4AYT1\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir le prix sur Amazon <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Notre avis</h2><p>À 299€ pour un smartphone 5G avec 512 Go de stockage, un capteur 200 MP et une batterie de 6580 mAh, Xiaomi frappe fort. C'est le genre de fiche technique qu'on trouve habituellement au-dessus de 400€ chez la concurrence. La certification IP68 et la garantie 2 ans rassurent sur la durabilité. Avec plus de 1200 avis et le badge Choix d'Amazon, c'est l'un des meilleurs rapports qualité-prix smartphone du moment.\n</p>9:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"article-content\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$17\"}}]}]\na:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{}]\nb:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"margin\":\"40px 0\",\"padding\":\"32px\",\"background\":\"linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF0F0 0%, #FFF8F0 100%)\",\"borderRadius\":\"16px\",\"border\":\"2px solid #FECDD3\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":800,\"fontSize\":\"1.2rem\",\"marginBottom\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"var(--foreground)\"},\"children\":\"Profiter de cette offre\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://amzn.to/3Q4AYT1\",\"className\":\"btn btn-primary\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"nofollow sponsored n